From 7839859e53c3d8550daeb5751ff23a2678f06303 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SenkOS
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:36:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Retro Handheld: SDL application target for Linux game
 handhelds

Based on IncognitoMan's PortMaster target (github.com/IncognitoMan/rockbox):
the 320x240 screen, keymap and plugin keypads, battery from sysfs. Here the pad
is read as an SDL game controller (no gptokeyb), the screen's brightness is the
system's (no backlight driver), and the files are the application's usual
places (--prefix, $HOME/.config/rockbox.org). Menu entry 208, target id 128,
keypad 82.

Upstream-Status: Pending [based on https://github.com/IncognitoMan/rockbox]
